  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOCELIP - Livelihoods &amp; Women&apos;s Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at significantly improving the health situation and economic independence of women in the project area and empowering them to advocate for their right and preparing them to take on leading positions in local government bodies. The project will develop the agriculture and business skills of the farmers (mostly female) and develop new market mechanism for sale of agricultural products. The project will focus on family health on nutrition, safe drinking water and maternal health.</narrative>
  </description>
